# Model scorecard

One row per PR. The lead routes issues on this table and re-routes between checkpoints on
the record so far, stating why in the issue. Tokens are metered by the harness from the
task result, never self-reported. A routing decision that does not cite a row is a guess.

Columns: **builder** is model and effort (or the second vendor's CLI). **launch→PR** and
**PR→merge** are wall-clock. **rework** is rounds routed back to the builder. **reviewer**
findings are blocking / mechanical (fixed on the branch) / routed. **2nd vendor** findings
are found / confirmed by the builder.

| PR | issue | builder | tokens (metered) | launch→PR | PR→merge | rework | reviewer b/m/r | 2nd vendor f/c | note |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
